# Build artifacts
lof-native
cpu_test
*.o
*.a

# Downloaded game archives and extracted game data (proprietary, do not commit)
downloads/
game/
*.zip
# Owner-supplied save files dropped at the repo root (proprietary game data;
# bootstrap.sh installs them into game/GAMES/).  Never commit these.
#
# NOTE: GAME1, GAME4 and GAME5 are *already* tracked in history (a pre-existing
# exception, see docs/OWNER-TASKS.md OT-001).  `.gitignore` does not untrack
# them, and the Cyldane fixture GAME4 is not in the archive, so it must stay
# committed or the only copy is lost.  This pattern still guards against
# *new* GAME* drops being committed by accident.
/GAME[0-9]*

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Scratch
*.tmp

# native drop-in binaries (build with `make port`)
/lof
/vor
font_test
char_test
dungeon_test
